    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>make-valid-ring-sources · 1×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 64 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-make-valid-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-make-valid-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAJ0ADkXbPd0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const ringSourceIdsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; ringSourceIds: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const FEATURE_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const POLYGON_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"14\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"15\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  _ = &amp;featureOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  _ = &amp;polygonOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  _ = &amp;ringSourceIds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  var polygonLow = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  var polygonHigh = POLYGON_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  while (polygonLow + 1u &lt; polygonHigh) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">    let middle = (polygonLow + polygonHigh) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    if (polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= index) { polygonLow = middle; } else { polygonHigh = middle; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  var featureLow = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  var featureHigh = FEATURE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  while (featureLow + 1u &lt; featureHigh) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    let middle = (featureLow + featureHigh) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">    if (featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= polygonLow) { featureLow = middle; } else { featureHigh = middle; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  ringSourceIds[ringSourceIdsOffset + index] = featureLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>featureOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"featureOffsets\">featureOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>polygonOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"polygonOffsets\">polygonOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>ringSourceIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"make-valid-ring-source-ids\">make-valid-ring-source-ids</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUMakeValid/ring-sources · main · e69b85b6</figcaption></figure></section>",
